# __SPOTKIT_DISPLAY_NAME__ app object

This project deliberately generates at most one app object. The starter schema
contains four practical properties and can be renamed before its first upload.
Once installed in customer accounts, treat schema names and property types as a
public compatibility contract.

App objects require HubSpot approval through the developer overview request
flow. Do not upload this component until the app has access. Add only properties
the product owns; use associations rather than duplicating CRM data.
